    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Sections\r\n\r\nIn this level, we'll use AI Tutor to help us understand section tags and add a new section to our webpage.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. Ask AI Tutor: \"How do sections work in HTML?\"\r\n    - You can type directly, or highlight lines of code and select **\"Add to AI Tutor\"**.\r\n2. Ask AI Tutor to add a new dance style to this page.\r\n    - Be specific - use clear terms or the tag name in your prompt (e.g., *\"Add a new `<section>` that...\"*).\r\n\r\nOnce you've added your content, click **Continue**.",
