          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Dance Styles Around the World</h1>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>Salsa</h2>\n      <p>Salsa is a lively partner dance with roots in Cuban and Puerto Rican music.</p>\n      <p>It is known for its quick footwork, hip movements, and energetic rhythm.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>Kathak</h2>\n      <p>Kathak is one of the major classical dance forms of India, originating in North India.</p>\n      <p>It features intricate footwork, graceful spins, and expressive storytelling through movement.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>Breakdancing</h2>\n      <p>Breakdancing, also called B-boying, emerged from the hip-hop culture of the Bronx in New York City.</p>\n      <p>It combines acrobatic moves, footwork, and freezes performed to the beat of the music.</p>\n    </section>\n\n  </body>\n</html>",
